WEBVTT

00:00:03.730 --> 00:00:06.760
I'm back; I've re-Turnered to PriParis!

00:00:06.760 --> 00:00:09.390
I missed you so much, Little Curly-Da Vinci!

00:00:09.390 --> 00:00:12.010
Where'd you Gogh to? I've been miss-Cézanne you!

00:00:12.010 --> 00:00:15.950
You can hide all you like, but I'll stay here the whole summer holidays if I have to-Da Vinci!

00:00:16.640 --> 00:00:18.210
Mademoiselle?

00:00:18.210 --> 00:00:21.940
Hibiki-san and the others went to the Parajuku PriPara...

00:00:21.940 --> 00:00:23.960
to complete their team formation.

00:00:31.150 --> 00:00:34.080
I feel... as though I detected some faint disturbance.

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:35.410
Was it my imagination?

00:00:35.410 --> 00:00:36.980
Say, there it is!

00:00:40.210 --> 00:00:43.840
It's only been five months, but it feels like we never left!

00:00:43.840 --> 00:00:45.280
Toriko too-tori!

00:00:45.280 --> 00:00:47.260
We're here, Maho-chan.

00:00:48.670 --> 00:00:51.340
Incidentally, Miss Kiki Ajimi...

00:00:51.340 --> 00:00:55.810
was successfully taken in by the plan to lure her to PriParis.

00:00:55.810 --> 00:00:57.220
Please be at ease.

00:00:57.220 --> 00:00:58.660
I knew I could count on you.

00:00:59.560 --> 00:01:03.090
Then, shall we bestow the flowers of love upon those maidens...

00:01:03.090 --> 00:01:05.120
who have waited in such sweet longing?

00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:08.840
Hibiki-sama's back!

00:01:08.840 --> 00:01:11.360
Welcome back, Hibiki-sama!

00:01:11.760 --> 00:01:13.810
Falulu, you're so lovely!

00:01:13.810 --> 00:01:16.220
I've been waiting for you, Fuwari-chan!

00:01:21.660 --> 00:01:24.700
My name is Shikyouin Hibiki... It's been far too long.

00:01:26.920 --> 00:01:28.610
I'm Midorikaze Fuwari!

00:01:28.610 --> 00:01:29.810
I'm Falulu!

00:01:29.810 --> 00:01:30.980
Toriko too-tori!

00:01:31.370 --> 00:01:34.150
Welcome back, everyone – and capisce!

00:01:34.150 --> 00:01:35.240
Shining!

00:01:36.070 --> 00:01:37.170
Capisce!

00:01:37.680 --> 00:01:39.370
I'm Manaka Lala!

00:01:39.370 --> 00:01:41.120
I'm in my sixth year of primary school!

00:01:41.470 --> 00:01:45.380
Keep winning through the Divine Idol Grand Prix and become a Divine Idol!

00:01:45.380 --> 00:01:47.920
All the other idols are amazing, but I won't give up!

00:01:47.920 --> 00:01:49.920
Cheer me on, everyone!

00:03:25.480 --> 00:03:27.520
Falulu! Fuwari!

00:03:27.520 --> 00:03:29.210
I'm glad you're doing well.

00:03:29.210 --> 00:03:29.860
Pushu!

00:03:29.860 --> 00:03:30.520
Pri!

00:03:31.130 --> 00:03:32.300
Thank you!

00:03:32.890 --> 00:03:35.890
Here, I brought some honey from the Palps as a souvenir.

00:03:35.890 --> 00:03:36.830
Try some.

00:03:36.830 --> 00:03:39.000
Thanks, it looks delicious!

00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:40.720
Tension max!

00:03:40.720 --> 00:03:41.390
Yeah!

00:03:41.390 --> 00:03:42.370
<i>Go</i>!

00:03:42.370 --> 00:03:45.160
You've earned the Devil's gratitude!

00:03:45.160 --> 00:03:46.810
And an angel's blessing!

00:03:46.810 --> 00:03:48.510
Garu!

00:03:48.510 --> 00:03:50.880
I'm glad to see you all again, too.

00:03:50.880 --> 00:03:52.430
Toriko too-tori!

00:03:52.430 --> 00:03:53.100
Kuma!

00:03:53.100 --> 00:03:53.720
Usa!

00:03:53.720 --> 00:03:54.790
Nekon!

00:03:55.220 --> 00:04:00.840
And I see, Midorikaze-san, that after all this time you remain barefoot.

00:04:00.840 --> 00:04:02.770
Hello, Principal Ookanda.

00:04:02.770 --> 00:04:09.440
I assumed as much, so I prepared some sandals for you:
they match Rina-chan perfectly and are hugely popular!

00:04:09.440 --> 00:04:11.440
Oh, they're simply darling!

00:04:11.440 --> 00:04:15.220
I'll take them hope and cherish them.

00:04:15.220 --> 00:04:17.980
I was intending for you to wear them now, though...

00:04:20.680 --> 00:04:22.910
And Hibiki-san in good health, too, makes me so...

00:04:22.910 --> 00:04:24.610
<i>pri</i>-eased to see!

00:04:25.730 --> 00:04:28.140
You destroyed the sentence ender-proof headphones?

00:04:28.140 --> 00:04:29.010
Andou!

00:04:29.820 --> 00:04:32.680
My sincere apologies.
It appears they've reached the end of their life.

00:04:32.680 --> 00:04:35.080
I'm prepare some replacements immediately.

00:04:35.080 --> 00:04:37.000
Please make do with this in the meantime.

00:04:37.700 --> 00:04:38.960
They suit you so well!

00:04:39.300 --> 00:04:40.460
The picture of opulence!

00:04:40.460 --> 00:04:41.080
Yeah!

00:04:41.080 --> 00:04:43.450
Maho-chan, your ears are like lovely vases!

00:04:43.450 --> 00:04:44.660
Dorothy...

00:04:45.470 --> 00:04:46.640
How ludicrous.

00:04:47.520 --> 00:04:48.410
But, Hibiki-sama...

00:04:48.410 --> 00:04:50.170
Don't worry: I'll manage.

00:04:50.170 --> 00:04:52.600
Just ensure you bring some new headphones quickly.

00:04:53.700 --> 00:04:54.920
<i>I was right...</i>

00:04:54.920 --> 00:04:58.730
<i>It would have been better to never return here.</i>

00:04:59.640 --> 00:05:00.540
<i>But...</i>

00:05:01.880 --> 00:05:05.150
<i>If it's what my savior Fuwari</i>

00:05:05.150 --> 00:05:06.900
<i>and Falulu desire...</i>

00:05:10.600 --> 00:05:13.010
<i>I couldn't well refuse to come back.</i>

00:05:14.060 --> 00:05:16.500
Are you okay, Maho-chan?

00:05:16.500 --> 00:05:17.640
Hibiki-san?

00:05:17.640 --> 00:05:18.880
Of course.

00:05:18.880 --> 00:05:22.050
Andou, get my souvenirs as well.

00:05:23.300 --> 00:05:28.000
Handbags from the luxury brand Permès, ordered specially.

00:05:28.000 --> 00:05:29.340
And we all get the same one?

00:05:29.340 --> 00:05:30.440
Dorothy!

00:05:30.440 --> 00:05:31.800
A superficial choice.

00:05:31.800 --> 00:05:33.330
Wow, thanks a lot, Hibiki-san!

00:05:34.570 --> 00:05:36.340
Lady Falulu!

00:05:36.340 --> 00:05:37.230
Non-chan!

00:05:38.220 --> 00:05:40.900
I'm so happy to see you in PriPara!

00:05:40.900 --> 00:05:44.220
I can't believe it! It's the real Lady Falulu!

00:05:44.220 --> 00:05:45.720
My life has meaning now!

00:05:46.810 --> 00:05:50.590
And you must be Manaka Lala's sister, Manaka Non.

00:05:50.590 --> 00:05:53.810
Yes, I am! You really do know everything.

00:05:54.480 --> 00:05:55.870
Pleased to meet you!

00:05:56.260 --> 00:05:59.550
Non-chan, congratulations on your début once again!

00:05:59.550 --> 00:06:00.860
And in commemoration:

00:06:00.860 --> 00:06:03.850
Just like Falulu's Non, I made a Non's Falulu!

00:06:05.300 --> 00:06:06.440
Isn't it cute?

00:06:06.440 --> 00:06:08.300
Yes! It's sorta kinda cute!

00:06:08.300 --> 00:06:09.550
Thank you so much!

00:06:11.880 --> 00:06:12.740
What's that?

00:06:12.740 --> 00:06:16.930
The reason you came to Parajuku is
to complete the team formation ceremony?

00:06:17.440 --> 00:06:19.470
You mean you hadn't done it?

00:06:19.470 --> 00:06:23.500
We've had many performances in PriParis,

00:06:23.500 --> 00:06:29.240
but I wanted to do the formation ceremony in front of everyone from Parajuku!

00:06:29.240 --> 00:06:30.700
So did I!

00:06:30.700 --> 00:06:32.530
That's why we all came over.

00:06:32.530 --> 00:06:34.200
Isn't that right, Maho-chan?

00:06:34.200 --> 00:06:35.290
That's right...

00:06:35.570 --> 00:06:37.420
I see!

00:06:37.420 --> 00:06:42.500
Oho! Then the ol' anti-friendship Maho-chan made some true friends after all, huh?

00:06:43.520 --> 00:06:48.060
You can't get out of saying it in
the ceremony's vow, you know-pri?

00:06:48.060 --> 00:06:50.980
Can she say it, I wonder, can she?

00:06:50.980 --> 00:06:52.510
She doesn't seem to want to...

00:06:53.660 --> 00:06:54.750
I can say it.

00:06:54.750 --> 00:06:55.810
Mm, make sure you do.

00:06:56.180 --> 00:06:58.210
I'm looking forward to the ceremony-pri!

00:06:58.210 --> 00:06:58.930
Yeah!

00:07:02.240 --> 00:07:03.940
Thank you for your patience.

00:07:03.940 --> 00:07:07.190
Preparations for the ceremony are now complete.

00:07:07.490 --> 00:07:08.360
Yes!
Okay!

00:07:09.160 --> 00:07:13.770
The Parajuku PriPara has prepared a special stage for the event.

00:07:13.770 --> 00:07:14.500
This way.

00:07:15.140 --> 00:07:16.360
Thank you.
Thank you very much.

00:07:16.360 --> 00:07:16.650
Thank you very much.

00:07:17.130 --> 00:07:19.700
Hey there, Meganii. Have you been well?

00:07:19.700 --> 00:07:23.150
Why yes, thank you. And I trust you have as well, Hibiki-san?

00:07:23.150 --> 00:07:27.400
I understand the matter of
the goddess Jewlie remains unsolved.

00:07:28.100 --> 00:07:29.590
As ineffectual as ever, I see.

00:07:30.430 --> 00:07:33.290
And your pleasantness remains unchanged as well.

00:08:01.160 --> 00:08:05.860
The team formation ceremony of Hibiki, Falulu and Fuwari...

00:08:05.860 --> 00:08:08.380
will begin momentarily.

00:08:11.390 --> 00:08:16.300
This programme is being broadcast worldwide as well.

00:08:21.770 --> 00:08:25.250
By the way, I haven't seen the
attending manager Unicorn-kuma.

00:08:25.250 --> 00:08:27.780
You're right; she doesn't seem to be around-usa.

00:08:28.260 --> 00:08:31.220
And we now present the attending manager, Toriko-san!

00:08:31.220 --> 00:08:32.930
Right this way!

00:08:32.930 --> 00:08:33.820
Tori!

00:08:33.820 --> 00:08:35.530
Usa-sa-sa!

00:08:35.530 --> 00:08:41.080
Wh–What? The unemployed blue bird of unhappiness become the manager for PriPara headquarters' top team?

00:08:41.080 --> 00:08:43.330
What a ridiculous turn of fortunes!

00:08:43.330 --> 00:08:44.680
I can't believe this-usa!

00:08:44.680 --> 00:08:48.340
Is it because Unicorn has her hooves full with the Mini Falulus-nekon?

00:08:48.880 --> 00:08:52.900
"I'll leave it with you, Toriko," she said-garu.

00:08:57.380 --> 00:08:59.890
I–I'm so honoured and ha–happy-tori!

00:08:59.890 --> 00:09:05.950
But I can't handle being happy, so I'm frozen in place right now-tori...

00:09:05.950 --> 00:09:10.230
Please, someone make me miserable again-tori...

00:09:12.330 --> 00:09:13.920
I'm plenty miserable now-tori.

00:09:15.060 --> 00:09:18.280
But now I've calmed down and
regained my peace of mind-tori!

00:09:18.280 --> 00:09:20.720
Thank you, Hibiki-san-tori!

00:09:20.720 --> 00:09:21.900
That's great.

00:09:21.900 --> 00:09:22.410
Yep!

00:09:23.840 --> 00:09:25.730
Some things never change, huh?

00:09:25.730 --> 00:09:26.780
She's so cute.

00:09:26.780 --> 00:09:29.840
She gets along with Hibiki better than you'd pri-sume.

00:09:30.220 --> 00:09:32.580
A step forward towards true teamwork.

00:09:32.580 --> 00:09:33.590
Isn't it great?

00:09:33.590 --> 00:09:34.430
Devi!
Geru!

00:09:34.430 --> 00:09:35.510
Garu!

00:09:40.910 --> 00:09:43.660
W–Well then! We'll pr–pr–proceed...

00:09:43.660 --> 00:09:48.440
with the team formation ceremony t–t–t–t... tori!

00:09:58.100 --> 00:10:01.280
Then, if you would please announce your team name!

00:10:01.900 --> 00:10:05.120
T–Tori! The three members' team name is...

00:10:05.120 --> 00:10:06.300
Is...

00:10:07.280 --> 00:10:10.040
We're a team of three very different members.

00:10:10.040 --> 00:10:13.150
Three people, three colours: Tricolore!

00:10:13.280 --> 00:10:14.020
It fits!

00:10:14.020 --> 00:10:15.240
It's so catchy!

00:10:15.240 --> 00:10:16.100
How wonderful!

00:10:16.100 --> 00:10:17.170
So cute!

00:10:17.620 --> 00:10:19.090
Sounds good!

00:10:19.710 --> 00:10:22.350
Do you like it, everyone?

00:10:22.350 --> 00:10:24.300
Yeah!

00:10:24.810 --> 00:10:28.230
Well, then, it's about time to begin the team formation ceremony.

00:10:28.780 --> 00:10:29.890
But first...

00:10:30.350 --> 00:10:30.830
A word from–

00:10:30.830 --> 00:10:32.160
A word from our sponsors.

00:10:43.980 --> 00:10:47.470
Well, then, it's about time to begin the team formation ceremony.

00:10:48.110 --> 00:10:50.420
The attending manager, Toriko-san...

00:10:50.420 --> 00:10:51.330
If you would.

00:10:51.520 --> 00:10:52.410
Tori!

00:10:53.010 --> 00:10:56.180
Tricolore members Hibiki, Falulu and Fuwari,

00:10:56.180 --> 00:10:57.620
step forward!

00:11:03.310 --> 00:11:05.940
I will preside from here on.

00:11:05.940 --> 00:11:07.040
Take your positions.

00:11:12.850 --> 00:11:17.160
As the team leader, Hibiki-san, please begin the oath.

00:11:17.630 --> 00:11:18.570
I begin?

00:11:18.920 --> 00:11:19.820
Go ahead.

00:11:21.880 --> 00:11:22.780
Promise:

00:11:27.570 --> 00:11:28.570
Hibiki-san?

00:11:29.120 --> 00:11:30.120
Hibiki-san!

00:11:30.720 --> 00:11:33.970
It's "Promise: Believe in friendship".

00:11:35.000 --> 00:11:36.840
I know that well enough!

00:11:36.840 --> 00:11:39.630
I was merely pausing for effect.

00:11:42.030 --> 00:11:42.930
Capisce!

00:11:43.390 --> 00:11:44.900
I wonder about that.

00:11:44.900 --> 00:11:46.010
Dorothy...

00:11:46.500 --> 00:11:48.470
Go ahead, then, Hibiki-san.

00:11:56.930 --> 00:11:57.970
Promise:

00:11:58.910 --> 00:12:00.070
"Promise"...

00:12:00.460 --> 00:12:02.400
Believe in only me!

00:12:06.810 --> 00:12:07.950
What?

00:12:10.460 --> 00:12:12.240
Don't try and sweep it under the rug.

00:12:12.240 --> 00:12:15.700
You definitely didn't say "friendship" just now.

00:12:15.700 --> 00:12:18.730
So? Look at how happy everyone is.

00:12:19.130 --> 00:12:20.860
Unfortunately, that won't do.

00:12:20.860 --> 00:12:23.220
This rule is set down by the PriPara constitution.

00:12:23.220 --> 00:12:26.020
Aren't you supposed to be on the idols' side?

00:12:26.020 --> 00:12:27.890
This is a separate matter.

00:12:30.380 --> 00:12:31.520
Hibiki-san?

00:12:31.520 --> 00:12:34.430
Maho-chan? Don't you want to be a team?

00:12:34.430 --> 00:12:35.250
Of course I do.

00:12:35.920 --> 00:12:38.040
Well, if that's the case...

00:12:38.040 --> 00:12:39.000
Go ahead.

00:12:46.650 --> 00:12:47.580
Promise:

00:12:48.840 --> 00:12:50.240
A pledge from the heart!

00:12:52.370 --> 00:12:53.980
Defining it is also incorrect.

00:12:55.260 --> 00:12:57.500
One more time, then, Hibiki-san.

00:12:57.870 --> 00:12:59.400
Tori...

00:13:05.380 --> 00:13:06.340
Promise:

00:13:07.600 --> 00:13:09.120
A pro's mistake.

00:13:11.740 --> 00:13:12.560
Meganii...

00:13:13.410 --> 00:13:15.770
Did you eat the bird feed that day?

00:13:20.030 --> 00:13:21.900
I did not... every day...

00:13:21.900 --> 00:13:22.420
Garu!

00:13:22.420 --> 00:13:23.340
He did eat it?

00:13:23.340 --> 00:13:24.110
Wowsers!

00:13:24.610 --> 00:13:27.810
Anyway, making a pun won't cut it either.

00:13:30.080 --> 00:13:31.630
Hibiki-san...

00:13:31.630 --> 00:13:33.460
Try it one more time.

00:13:40.720 --> 00:13:41.380
Hmph...

00:13:42.540 --> 00:13:43.640
Promise:

00:13:43.640 --> 00:13:47.770
A yellow flower found mainly on the east Mediterranean coast!

00:13:53.310 --> 00:13:54.780
Also incorrect.

00:13:54.780 --> 00:13:59.410
By the way, we need to move on to the next team's ceremony,

00:13:59.410 --> 00:14:02.050
so we'll be out of time if you can't say it now.

00:14:02.050 --> 00:14:03.320
What?

00:14:03.880 --> 00:14:05.260
Say what now?

00:14:06.020 --> 00:14:07.360
Maho-chan...

00:14:07.360 --> 00:14:08.240
Hibiki-san...

00:14:08.840 --> 00:14:10.240
All right, so be it.

00:14:10.240 --> 00:14:12.800
I just have to say it, right?

00:14:12.800 --> 00:14:13.950
Have no fear.

00:14:14.460 --> 00:14:18.350
Then, Hibiki-san – this is your final answer!

00:14:38.660 --> 00:14:39.580
Promise:

00:14:44.660 --> 00:14:46.450
<i>Why can't I say it?</i>

00:14:46.450 --> 00:14:48.180
<i>I thought I'd be able to...</i>

00:14:49.240 --> 00:14:50.490
<i>Friendship...</i>

00:14:50.490 --> 00:14:52.540
<i>Friendship, friendship...</i>

00:14:52.540 --> 00:14:53.130
<i>Friend...</i>

00:14:54.840 --> 00:14:55.780
<i>I can't say it.</i>

00:14:58.740 --> 00:15:00.610
So they postponed it after all...

00:15:00.610 --> 00:15:02.180
What a shame, huh?

00:15:04.030 --> 00:15:05.920
Tori!

00:15:05.920 --> 00:15:09.730
I knew it! I could only call forth misfortune after all-tori!

00:15:09.730 --> 00:15:11.320
Do you want to enter the Grand Prix?

00:15:11.320 --> 00:15:12.290
I do.

00:15:12.290 --> 00:15:13.850
Then you can say it, right?

00:15:13.850 --> 00:15:14.890
No.

00:15:14.890 --> 00:15:16.030
You want to enter, right?

00:15:16.030 --> 00:15:17.080
I do.

00:15:17.080 --> 00:15:18.120
Then, say it.

00:15:18.120 --> 00:15:18.830
No.

00:15:19.690 --> 00:15:21.310
You said not to worry.

00:15:21.740 --> 00:15:23.720
I thought I'd be able to say it then.

00:15:27.500 --> 00:15:28.580
Are you okay?

00:15:28.580 --> 00:15:29.490
You guys.

00:15:29.490 --> 00:15:31.560
We're not okay at all-tori!

00:15:31.560 --> 00:15:36.200
At this rate we won't form a team or enter the Grand Prix at all-tori!

00:15:36.620 --> 00:15:41.710
Well, that's true, but you couldn't enter in the first place,

00:15:41.710 --> 00:15:44.590
since Jewlie hasn't given you Super Cyalume Coords-kuma.

00:15:44.590 --> 00:15:45.570
Is that true-tori?

00:15:45.570 --> 00:15:45.900
Yep.

00:15:45.900 --> 00:15:48.670
My unhappiness only grows deeper-tori!

00:15:48.670 --> 00:15:50.330
Tori-tori-tori!

00:15:52.220 --> 00:15:53.250
Mama!

00:15:53.770 --> 00:15:55.280
So this is little Jululu?

00:15:55.280 --> 00:15:57.450
She's simply precious!

00:15:57.450 --> 00:16:00.300
Nice to meet you, Jululu-chan. I'm Fuwari.

00:16:00.300 --> 00:16:04.150
Lu-lu-lu-lu-lu. Lu-lu-lu-lu-lu.

00:16:06.040 --> 00:16:07.110
Her skin is so soft.

00:16:07.700 --> 00:16:09.150
So that's Jululu.

00:16:09.820 --> 00:16:14.460
<i>If I ingratiate myself with her, I can get my hands on a Super Cyalume Coord, then?</i>

00:16:15.780 --> 00:16:17.780
Fuwari! Falulu!

00:16:17.780 --> 00:16:21.180
We'll put aside the matter of the formation ceremony for now...

00:16:21.180 --> 00:16:23.960
And focus on obtaining Super Cyalume Coords.

00:16:23.960 --> 00:16:24.720
What?

00:16:25.570 --> 00:16:27.620
So you're Jululu?

00:16:27.620 --> 00:16:29.070
Look this way now.

00:16:29.070 --> 00:16:31.090
I'll make you my fan in two seconds.

00:16:33.220 --> 00:16:34.900
Don't hold back, little babe.

00:16:35.550 --> 00:16:37.960
Come, fly into my arms.

00:16:39.790 --> 00:16:41.140
Not your leg.

00:16:41.960 --> 00:16:43.200
Take my hand.

00:16:45.870 --> 00:16:48.650
"Maho-chan's hand is warm," she says.

00:16:48.650 --> 00:16:49.810
What?

00:16:49.810 --> 00:16:52.730
Falulu... You can understand what Jululu says?

00:16:52.730 --> 00:16:53.560
Yes!

00:16:53.560 --> 00:16:54.780
What?

00:16:54.780 --> 00:16:56.330
No way!

00:16:56.330 --> 00:17:00.290
In that case, could you ask her why she became a baby-pri?

00:17:00.290 --> 00:17:01.040
Yeah!

00:17:01.740 --> 00:17:02.780
Sure thing.

00:17:03.400 --> 00:17:04.520
Why is it?

00:17:06.190 --> 00:17:07.250
What did she say?

00:17:07.690 --> 00:17:10.170
"Maho-chan's hand is warm," she says.

00:17:11.680 --> 00:17:14.770
Cheeky little brat, ain't ya?

00:17:14.770 --> 00:17:16.810
You know, Hibiki-san...

00:17:16.810 --> 00:17:21.140
Even <i>Dorothy</i> was acknowledged by Jewlie and granted a Super Cyalume Coord.

00:17:21.280 --> 00:17:22.930
Oi, whaddya mean "even" me?

00:17:22.930 --> 00:17:24.180
Hmph!

00:17:24.180 --> 00:17:26.280
It will be a piece of cake for me, then.

00:17:26.280 --> 00:17:27.630
I thank you for your concern.

00:17:28.440 --> 00:17:29.980
Where's the baby?

00:17:32.320 --> 00:17:33.990
silence
silence

00:17:35.610 --> 00:17:38.930
Maho-chan, what if you performed for Jululu-chan?

00:17:38.930 --> 00:17:41.990
That's a good idea; Jululu loves idols!

00:17:41.990 --> 00:17:45.910
I'll sing as well. Hibiki-san, let's perform together.

00:17:46.830 --> 00:17:47.890
We'll do that song!

00:17:49.100 --> 00:17:50.320
"That song"?

00:17:59.450 --> 00:18:02.560
Scan the appropriate number of MyTickets for your coord.

00:18:03.390 --> 00:18:05.950
You can also scan each other's Friend Tickets.

00:18:05.950 --> 00:18:07.960
Starting the Coord Change.

00:18:09.730 --> 00:18:15.530
A sky-blue coord, taking inspiration from Tyrolean patterns for an ethnic feel.

00:18:15.530 --> 00:18:17.890
Palps Sky Country Coord!

00:18:21.680 --> 00:18:26.880
The princely style features a gallant
royal blue jacket and sleek white pants!

00:18:26.880 --> 00:18:29.600
Brilliant Prince Cyalume Coord!

00:18:34.220 --> 00:18:36.470
I'm going to sing together with Hibiki-san!

00:18:36.900 --> 00:18:38.540
Please listen to our song...

00:18:38.540 --> 00:18:40.210
"Come and Join This Song, Layhee"!

00:18:41.810 --> 00:18:44.200
Hibiki-san, look over here!

00:19:40.070 --> 00:19:43.410
Making Drama, switch on!

00:19:45.140 --> 00:19:46.410
Let's go!

00:19:50.780 --> 00:19:55.920
Did you drop this gold Hibiki or this silver Hibiki?

00:19:56.600 --> 00:19:58.600
The statue I dropped...

00:19:58.600 --> 00:20:00.530
is this wood-carved Hibiki statue!

00:20:02.930 --> 00:20:05.860
Stop being silly and come over here.

00:20:08.300 --> 00:20:11.220
And after I went to all the trouble of playing the fool...

00:20:13.410 --> 00:20:15.460
Oh, don't be like that...

00:20:15.460 --> 00:20:16.200
Nachu!

00:20:16.200 --> 00:20:17.960
"Nachu"?

00:20:19.600 --> 00:20:22.340
Cyalume Change!

00:20:48.010 --> 00:20:50.720
Lu-lu-lu! Lu-lu-lu!

00:20:53.000 --> 00:20:55.100
Now, to the Divine Idol stage!

00:20:55.730 --> 00:20:59.130
Divine Idol Challenge, switch on!

00:21:01.730 --> 00:21:04.980
Divine Jewel, Cyalume Jewel Mic!

00:21:05.700 --> 00:21:09.600
Let the challenge commence...
to become a Divine Idol!

00:21:27.900 --> 00:21:31.560
The closet's doors open for you...

00:21:31.560 --> 00:21:34.200
Within is a coord fit for a Divine Idol!

00:21:51.420 --> 00:21:55.520
<i>Fuwari was the only one to get a Super Cyalume Coord?</i>

00:21:55.520 --> 00:21:57.540
<i>That accursed baby...</i>

00:21:59.690 --> 00:22:01.330
Well, I've had enough!

00:22:01.330 --> 00:22:03.210
I demand a duel!

00:22:04.640 --> 00:22:06.040
What are you doing to Jululu?

00:22:06.040 --> 00:22:08.720
I'll take up your challenge on her behalf!

00:22:10.300 --> 00:22:13.010
So she has a glove pri-pared for this at all times...

00:22:13.010 --> 00:22:15.050
I was unaware myself until just now.

00:23:51.320 --> 00:23:54.160
There's big trouble! We got an SOS!

00:23:54.160 --> 00:23:55.780
Who sent it-pri?

00:23:55.780 --> 00:23:59.000
I don't know! But it says it's from the Sapanna!

00:23:59.000 --> 00:24:01.520
The Sapanna – that's in Aprica-pri!

00:24:01.520 --> 00:24:03.060
The Sapanna PriPara?

00:24:03.060 --> 00:24:05.660
Wow! There's wildlife everywhere!

00:24:05.660 --> 00:24:08.760
The dangerous wild animals are all coming here as well!

00:24:08.760 --> 00:24:11.000
Where did all the girls go?

00:24:11.000 --> 00:24:14.370
There's no way we can put on a performance here-pri!

00:24:14.370 --> 00:24:16.980
Next time, <i>An SOS from the Sapanna</i>!

00:24:16.980 --> 00:24:19.770
Aim to be a Divine Idol! Let's go, PriPara!
